> I uncursed it and I have been using it to good effect, getting the usual
> Magicbane effects (probe, stun, scare, etc).
>
> After a battle with an ochre jelly, I got the message that Magicbane
> became corroded. Sure enough, in my inventory it is corroded.
>
> I thought artifacts were immune to corrosion effects? What gives?
>
> Jack

Artifacts aren't immune to rust / corrosion, it's just that most of the
ways in which they get generated make them be immune.  For instance, if
you get it gifted from your god it's proofed, and if you wish for it
you usually wish it proofed.  However, if it gets randomly generated
then it's not proofed, so that's probably what happened to the guy
whose bones you found.

